<title>CANADA: Toronto stocks close mixed despite Wall St tumble.</title>
<headline>Toronto stocks close mixed despite Wall St tumble.</headline>
<text>
<p>CHANGE				    CHANGE</p>
<p>TSE	 6121.52    -8.44   HI 6132.50	    LO  6120.35</p>
<p>DJI	 7085.65  -139.67   GOLD (LONDON)   US$341.10 -1.35</p>
<p>FTSE100   4537.50   +18.20   GOLD (NY-COMEX) US$342.40 +0.90</p>
<p>NIKKEI   20048.90  -132.02   LME CASH NICKEL US$7390   +73.0</p>
<p>CANDLR    1.3817		 LME CASH ALUM   US$1606.5  -3.5</p>
<p>CAN 30-YR 109.85     -1.25   BRENT CRUDE     US$18.13  +0.09</p>
<p>--------------------MARKET COMMENT----------------------------</p>
<p>* Toronto stocks ended mixed on Wednesday as heavyweight golds spiked upward, offsetting the downward pressure of a tumbling Wall Street. * 123 million shares traded worth C$1.5 billion.</p>
